      "narration_text": "The foundation is unglamorous: find enough bird images, legally. Komal is pulling from Unsplash, Pexels, and the U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service. All three are free to use. None of them are free in the same way — and a model trained on the wrong image is a problem you inherit much later.",
